title: "MRI Guardian Layer"
type: software
version: 0.1.0
date-released: 2026-03-26
abstract: >-
  ICSD-based verification proxy for raw MRI reconstruction workflows that proves
  released reconstruction, segmentation, and tumour-volume outputs are derived
  from raw k-space before PACS or workstation handoff.
